# A11 result

A11 is preserved as `STOP_HARNESS_X11_EXCLUSIVE_EVENT_MASK`. The actual process backend admitted both key holds and an independent pointer query saw Button1 down. The X server rejected the independent observer's ButtonPress/Release event selection with `BadAccess`, because the focus client had selected the same exclusive button mask. The gate stopped before session death and the owner was force-terminated; no recovery conclusion is available. A11 is not retried. A12 assigns button event selection only to the independent observer.
